      ],
      "orig": "An unmanned aerial vehicle (UAV), or drone, includes a fuselage 12, left and right airfoil-shaped wings 14, 16 connected to the fuselage to generate lift in forward flight, a left thrust-generating device 18 supported by the left wing, and a right thrust-generating device 20 supported by the right wing. The UAV further includes a vertical stabilizer, a top thrust-generating device 28 mounted to a top portion of the stabilizer, and a bottom thrust-generating device 34 mounted to a bottom portion. An onboard battery 38 powers the thrust-generating devices, enabling the UAV to transition between forward flight and vertical take-off and landing.",
      "text": "An unmanned aerial vehicle (UAV), or drone, includes a fuselage 12, left and right airfoil-shaped wings 14, 16 connected to the fuselage to generate lift in forward flight, a left thrust-generating device 18 supported by the left wing, and a right thrust-generating device 20 supported by the right wing. The UAV further includes a vertical stabilizer, a top thrust-generating device 28 mounted to a top portion of the stabilizer, and a bottom thrust-generating device 34 mounted to a bottom portion. An onboard battery 38 powers the thrust-generating devices, enabling the UAV to transition between forward flight and vertical take-off and landing."
    },
