      ],
      "orig": "A variety of unmanned aerial vehicles, colloquially known as drones, have been developed for military, reconnaissance and recreational uses such as aerial photography. UAVs can be gas-powered or electrically powered and can be fixed-wing or rotary-wing.",
      "text": "A variety of unmanned aerial vehicles, colloquially known as drones, have been developed for military, reconnaissance and recreational uses such as aerial photography. UAVs can be gas-powered or electrically powered and can be fixed-wing or rotary-wing."
    },
    {
      "self_ref": "#/texts/37",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/body"
      },
      "children": [],
      "content_layer": "body",
      "label": "text",
      "prov": [
        {
          "page_no": 1,
          "bbox": {
            "l": 321.0,
            "t": 614.8594,
            "r": 566.4000000000002,
            "b": 556.1819,
            "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"
          },
          "charspan": [
            0,
            342
          ]
        }
      ],
      "orig": "Reconnaissance UAVs are well suited to monitor or surveil remotely situated infrastructure such as oil or water pipelines, electric power lines, coastlines, farmland, borders, and forest fires. There is accordingly a need in the industry for improved unmanned aerial vehicles capable of performing extended, long-distance aerial surveillance.",
      "text": "Reconnaissance UAVs are well suited to monitor or surveil remotely situated infrastructure such as oil or water pipelines, electric power lines, coastlines, farmland, borders, and forest fires. There is accordingly a need in the industry for improved unmanned aerial vehicles capable of performing extended, long-distance aerial surveillance."
    },
    {
      "self_ref": "#/texts/38",
      "parent": {
        "$ref": "#/body"
