            253
          ]
        }
      ],
      "orig": "The UAV 10 includes a fuselage 12 which may be made of one or more composite materials, e.g. carbon fiber, fiberglass, or a suitable metal such as aluminum. The airframe also includes left and right airfoil-shaped wings 14, 16 connected to the fuselage.",
      "text": "The UAV 10 includes a fuselage 12 which may be made of one or more composite materials, e.g. carbon fiber, fiberglass, or a suitable metal such as aluminum. The airframe also includes left and right airfoil-shaped wings 14, 16 connected to the fuselage."
    },
