      ],
      "orig": "The UAV has a left thrust-generating device 18 supported by the left wing 14 and a right thrust-generating device 20 supported by the right wing 16, mechanically coupled to left and right propellers 22, 24.",
      "text": "The UAV has a left thrust-generating device 18 supported by the left wing 14 and a right thrust-generating device 20 supported by the right wing 16, mechanically coupled to left and right propellers 22, 24."
    },
