          ]
        }
      ],
      "orig": "The UAV has three batteries 38 symmetrically housed within the airframe: two batteries 38 are disposed within the left and right wings while a third battery 38 is disposed within the fuselage. The battery or batteries 38 may be inductively recharged via wireless power transfer (WPT) circuitry 40 while the UAV is in a tail-sitting position on a recharging pad.",
      "text": "The UAV has three batteries 38 symmetrically housed within the airframe: two batteries 38 are disposed within the left and right wings while a third battery 38 is disposed within the fuselage. The battery or batteries 38 may be inductively recharged via wireless power transfer (WPT) circuitry 40 while the UAV is in a tail-sitting position on a recharging pad."
    },
