      "text": "An unmanned aerial vehicle comprising: a fuselage 12; left and right airfoil-shaped wings 14, 16 connected to the fuselage and configured to generate lift in forward flight; a left thrust-generating device 18 supported by the left wing; a right thrust-generating device 20 supported by the right wing; a vertical stabilizer having a top portion 26 and a bottom portion 32; a top thrust-generating device 28 mounted to the top portion; a bottom thrust-generating device 34 mounted to the bottom portion; and an onboard power source for powering the thrust-generating devices.",
